From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:43:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2665/3799] soh: rename D_8082B030 -> sPageVtxY

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the per-page Y offset tables, indexed by pageIndex
Defined in soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c    | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c b/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c
index 704242324..922b93176 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c
@@ -2716,7 +2716,8 @@ static s16* sPageVtxWidths[] = {  // was D_8082B018 [LLM:HIGH]
     sPageVtxWidths0, sPageVtxWidths1, sPageVtxWidths2, sPageVtxWidths3, sCloudTexWidths, sPageVtxWidths5,  // was D_8082AAEC [LLM:HIGH]
 };
 
-static s16* D_8082B030[] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_8082B030: the per-page Y offset tables, indexed by pageIndex
+static s16* sPageVtxY[] = {  // was D_8082B030 [LLM:HIGH]
     sPageVtxY0, sPageVtxY1, sPageVtxY2, sPageVtxY3, sPageVtxY4, sPageVtxY5,  // was D_8082AF48 [LLM:HIGH]
 };
 
@@ -2902,7 +2903,7 @@ s16 KaleidoScope_SetPageVtx(PlayState* play, Vtx* vtx, s16 pageIndex, s16 arg3)
     if (arg3 != 0) {
         ptr1 = sPageVtxX[pageIndex];  // was D_8082B000 [LLM:HIGH]
         ptr2 = sPageVtxWidths[pageIndex];  // was D_8082B018 [LLM:HIGH]
-        ptr3 = D_8082B030[pageIndex];
+        ptr3 = sPageVtxY[pageIndex];  // was D_8082B030 [LLM:HIGH]
         ptr4 = D_8082B048[pageIndex];
 
         for (colorIndex = 0; colorIndex < arg3; colorIndex++, vtxIndex += 4) {
